<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia December C/A deficit narrows to $4.9 mln.</title>
<headline>Slovenia December C/A deficit narrows to $4.9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Slovenia reported the following preliminary December economic indicator details on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    CURRENT ACCOUNT BALANCE    (in million of dollars)</p>
<p>				  Dec  Nov   Dec95  Jan-Dec96 Jan-Dec95</p>
<p>Current account balance   -4.9 -94.6 -154.2  +46.4   -36.4</p>
<p>Merchandise trade balance-50.7 -192 -204 -852.8 -953.5 Exports			654.4  634   640   8,365.5  8,344.9</p>
<p>Imports 705.1 826 844 9,218.4 9,298.3</p>
<p>-- Marja Novak, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
